      "hizbQuarter": 142,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2836,
      "text": "Allah created every living creature from water. Some of them move on their bellies, and some walk on two legs and some walk on four. Allah creates what He wills. Allah is the Most Capable of all things.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 24,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النُّورِ",
        "englishName": "An-Noor",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Light",
        "numberOfAyahs": 64,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 356,
      "ruku": 306,
      "hizbQuarter": 142,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2837,
      "text": "We have sent down verses making things clear, and Allah guides whom He wills to a straight path.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 24,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النُّورِ",
        "englishName": "An-Noor",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Light",
        "numberOfAyahs": 64,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 356,
      "ruku": 306,
      "hizbQuarter": 142,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2838,
      "text": "The hypocrites say, “We believe in Allah and in the Messenger, and we obey.” Then a party of them turns away after that. Such are not believers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 24,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النُّورِ",
        "englishName": "An-Noor",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Light",
        "numberOfAyahs": 64,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 356,
      "ruku": 306,
      "hizbQuarter": 142,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2839,
      "text": "When they are called to Allah and His Messenger so that he may judge between them, a party of them turns away.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 24,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النُّورِ",
        "englishName": "An-Noor",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Light",
        "numberOfAyahs": 64,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 356,
      "ruku": 306,
      "hizbQuarter": 142,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2840,
      "text": "But if the right is in their favor, they come to him in full submission[29].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 24,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النُّورِ",
        "englishName": "An-Noor",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Light",
        "numberOfAyahs": 64,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 356,
      "ruku": 306,
      "hizbQuarter": 142,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2841,
      "text": "Is there sickness in their hearts, or do they have doubt, or do they fear that Allah and His messenger will be unjust to them? Rather, it is they who are the wrongdoers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 24,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النُّورِ",
        "englishName": "An-Noor",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Light",
        "numberOfAyahs": 64,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 356,
      "ruku": 306,
      "hizbQuarter": 142,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2842,
      "text": "As for the believers, when they are called to Allah and His Messenger so that he may judge between them, they say, “We listen and obey.” It is they who are successful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 24,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النُّورِ",
        "englishName": "An-Noor",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Light",
        "numberOfAyahs": 64,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 356,
      "ruku": 307,
      "hizbQuarter": 142,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2843,
      "text": "Whoever obeys Allah and His Messenger, and fears Allah and is conscious of Him – it is they who are the triumphant.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 24,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النُّورِ",
        "englishName": "An-Noor",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Light",
        "numberOfAyahs": 64,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 18,
