      "hizbQuarter": 142,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2844,
      "text": "The hypocrites swear by Allah their most solemn oaths that if you order them, they will surely march forth. Say, “Do not swear, [your] obedience is well known[30]. Allah is All-Aware of what you do.”",
